# EEG data restricted by data use agreement. Do not commit these.
# TUH corpus subsets are covered by the NEDC / Temple University DUA. They were
# hosted here during the June 2026 workshop so participants could load them from
# the course notebooks, under the teaching arrangement agreed with NEDC. That
# arrangement ended with the course, and the files were removed on 2026-08-26 by
# rewriting the history. Any future access should go through individual NEDC
# registrations rather than this repository. YSUTH holds clinical recordings
# from Yobe State University Teaching Hospital and was removed at the same time.
2026/Data/TUH_EEG_Corpus/
2026/Data/YSUTH/

# Raw EEG recordings, wherever they appear.
*.edf
